#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

// #taxon[Taxon]
#title[Burnsides Lemma]

Let $G$ be a finite group and let $X : B G -> "Set"$ be a finite $G$-set.
Then each $X^g$, the type $sum 
_(g : U G) X^g$ and the set of orbits $X slash G$ are finite sets, and we have
$
  |sum_(g : U G) X^g | = | X slash G | * | U G |
$
